      "number": 3,
      "question": "Which among the following are called the amphibians of the plant kingdom? &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2361;&#2375;&#2306; &#2357;&#2344;&#2360;&#2381;&#2346;&#2340;&#2367; &#2332;&#2327;&#2340; &#2325;&#2366; &#2332;&#2354;&#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2354;&#2330;&#2352; &#2325;&#2361;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Which among the following are called the amphibians of the plant kingdom?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2361;&#2375;&#2306; &#2357;&#2344;&#2360;&#2381;&#2346;&#2340;&#2367; &#2332;&#2327;&#2340; &#2325;&#2366; &#2332;&#2354;&#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2354;&#2330;&#2352; &#2325;&#2361;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Pteridophytes &#2335;&#2376;&#2352;&#2367;&#2337;&#2379;&#2347;&#2366;&#2311;&#2335;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Pteridophytes</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2335;&#2376;&#2352;&#2367;&#2337;&#2379;&#2347;&#2366;&#2311;&#2335;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Gymnosperms &#2332;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2379;&#2360;&#2381;&#2346;&#2352;&#2381;&#2350;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Gymnosperms</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2332;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2379;&#2360;&#2381;&#2346;&#2352;&#2381;&#2350;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Bryophytes &#2348;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2351;&#2379;&#2347;&#2366;&#2311;&#2335;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Bryophytes</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2348;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2351;&#2379;&#2347;&#2366;&#2311;&#2335;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Liverworts &#2354;&#2367;&#2357;&#2352;&#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2335;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Liverworts</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2354;&#2367;&#2357;&#2352;&#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2335;</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p><b>Bryophytes</b> are called the amphibians of the plant kingdom. Which include ferns and their relatives, share characteristics that enable them to adapt to both aquatic and terrestrial environments, much like amphibians in the animal kingdom.</p>",
