      "number": 5,
      "question": "______ Plants that do not have well-differentiated body design fall in this group. The plants in this group are commonly called algae. These plants are predominantly aquatic. &#2346;&#2380;&#2343;&#2375; &#2332;&#2367;&#2344;&#2325;&#2375; &#2358;&#2352;&#2368;&#2352; &#2325;&#2368; &#2360;&#2306;&#2352;&#2330;&#2344;&#2366; &#2309;&#2330;&#2381;&#2331;&#2368; &#2340;&#2352;&#2361; &#2360;&#2375; &#2357;&#2367;&#2349;&#2375;&#2342;&#2367;&#2340; &#2344;&#2361;&#2368;&#2306; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2357;&#2375; ____ &#2360;&#2350;&#2370;&#2361; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2310;&#2340;&#2375; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404; &#2311;&#2360; &#2360;&#2350;&#2370;&#2361; &#2325;&#2375; &#2346;&#2380;&#2343;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379; &#2360;&#2366;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344;&#2381;&#2351;&#2340;&#2307; &#2358;&#2376;&#2357;&#2366;&#2354; &#2325;&#2361;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2351;&#2375; &#2346;&#2380;&#2343;&#2375; &#2350;&#2369;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2360;&#2375; &#2332;&#2354;&#2368;&#2351; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2375; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404;",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>______ Plants that do not have well-differentiated body design fall in this group. The plants in this group are commonly called algae. These plants are predominantly aquatic.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2346;&#2380;&#2343;&#2375; &#2332;&#2367;&#2344;&#2325;&#2375; &#2358;&#2352;&#2368;&#2352; &#2325;&#2368; &#2360;&#2306;&#2352;&#2330;&#2344;&#2366; &#2309;&#2330;&#2381;&#2331;&#2368; &#2340;&#2352;&#2361; &#2360;&#2375; &#2357;&#2367;&#2349;&#2375;&#2342;&#2367;&#2340; &#2344;&#2361;&#2368;&#2306; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2357;&#2375; ____ &#2360;&#2350;&#2370;&#2361; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2310;&#2340;&#2375; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404; &#2311;&#2360; &#2360;&#2350;&#2370;&#2361; &#2325;&#2375; &#2346;&#2380;&#2343;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379; &#2360;&#2366;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344;&#2381;&#2351;&#2340;&#2307; &#2358;&#2376;&#2357;&#2366;&#2354; &#2325;&#2361;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2351;&#2375; &#2346;&#2380;&#2343;&#2375; &#2350;&#2369;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2360;&#2375; &#2332;&#2354;&#2368;&#2351; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2375; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404;</p></span>",
