    {
      "id": "689091aa29aa-q6",
      "number": 6,
      "question": "Which of the following is NOT related to reticulate venation? &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2332;&#2366;&#2354;&#2368;&#2342;&#2366;&#2352; &#2358;&#2367;&#2352;&#2366;&#2357;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2360; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343;&#2367;&#2340; &#2344;&#2361;&#2368;&#2306; &#2361;&#2376;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Which of the following is NOT related to reticulate venation?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2332;&#2366;&#2354;&#2368;&#2342;&#2366;&#2352; &#2358;&#2367;&#2352;&#2366;&#2357;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2360; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343;&#2367;&#2340; &#2344;&#2361;&#2368;&#2306; &#2361;&#2376;?</span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "China rose &#2330;&#2368;&#2344; &#2327;&#2369;&#2354;&#2366;&#2348;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">China rose</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2330;&#2368;&#2344; &#2327;&#2369;&#2354;&#2366;&#2348;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Tulsi &#2340;&#2369;&#2354;&#2360;&#2368;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Tulsi</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2340;&#2369;&#2354;&#2360;&#2368;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Maize &#2350;&#2325;&#2381;&#2325;&#2366;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Maize</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2350;&#2325;&#2381;&#2325;&#2366;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Coriander &#2343;&#2344;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Coriander</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2343;&#2344;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>Venation refers to the pattern of veins in leaves:</p><p>&bull; Reticulate venation (net-like structure) is found in dicots (e.g., China rose, Tulsi, Coriander).</p><p>&bull; Parallel venation (parallel veins) is found in monocots (e.g., Maize, Grass, Banana).</p><p>Thus, Maize does not have reticulate venation.</p>",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "689091aa29aa-q7",
      "number": 7,
      "question": "Who explained the structure and reproductive system of algae in 1935? &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; 1935 &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2358;&#2376;&#2357;&#2366;&#2354; &#2325;&#2368; &#2360;&#2306;&#2352;&#2330;&#2344;&#2366; &#2319;&#2357;&#2306; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2332;&#2344;&#2344; &#2340;&#2306;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352; &#2325;&#2368; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2325;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2361;&#2379;&#2306;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2368; &#2341;&#2368;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Who explained the structure and reproductive system of algae in 1935?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; 1935 &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2358;&#2376;&#2357;&#2366;&#2354; &#2325;&#2368; &#2360;&#2306;&#2352;&#2330;&#2344;&#2366; &#2319;&#2357;&#2306; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2332;&#2344;&#2344; &#2340;&#2306;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352; &#2325;&#2368; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2325;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2361;&#2379;&#2306;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2368; &#2341;&#2368;?</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "MOP Iyengar &#2319;&#2350;.&#2323;.&#2346;&#2368;. &#2309;&#2351;&#2306;&#2327;&#2352;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">MOP Iyengar</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2319;&#2350;.&#2323;.&#2346;&#2368;. &#2309;&#2351;&#2306;&#2327;&#2352;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "FE Fritsch &#2319;&#2347;.&#2312;. &#2347;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2335;&#2381;&#2358;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">FE Fritsch</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2319;&#2347;.&#2312;. &#2347;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2335;&#2381;&#2358;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "William Henry &#2357;&#2367;&#2354;&#2367;&#2351;&#2350; &#2361;&#2375;&#2344;&#2352;&#2368;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">William Henry</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2357;&#2367;&#2354;&#2367;&#2351;&#2350; &#2361;&#2375;&#2344;&#2352;&#2368;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Carolus Linnaeus &#2325;&#2376;&#2352;&#2379;&#2354;&#2360; &#2354;&#2368;&#2344;&#2367;&#2351;&#2360;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Carolus Linnaeus</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2376;&#2352;&#2379;&#2354;&#2360; &#2354;&#2368;&#2344;&#2367;&#2351;&#2360;</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>F.E. Fritsch (1935, 1945) in his book \"The Structure and Reproduction of the Algae\" proposed a system of classification of algae. He treated algae giving rank of division and divided it into 11 classes. His classification of algae is mainly based upon characters of pigments, flagella and reserve food material.</p>",
